#
# OpenCreative++ - Build. Code. Play.
# Unofficial fork of OpenCreative+ by McChicken Studio.
#

OpenCreative++ 1.0.0 - Build. Code. Play.

  First version of OpenCreative++, based on OpenCreative+ 6.0.0 Pre-release 9.

  Platform
  - Updated to Paper 1.21.11 and Java 21, Gradle build
  - Renamed plugin to OpenCreativePP, data folder plugins/OpenCreativePP
  - Data from plugins/OpenCreative is copied automatically on first start
  - New permissions: opencreativepp.player, opencreativepp.premium, opencreativepp.admin
  - Russian is the default language, Ukrainian translation for all new texts
  - Changed texts are refreshed on existing servers once per locale revision
  - Update checker of the original is disabled by default

  Config
  - Split config into config.yml, groups.yml, worlds.yml, items.yml, chat.yml,
    datapacks.yml, shop.yml and sounds.yml with comments
  - Old single config.yml is split into the new files automatically
  - Broken files are renamed instead of being reset, the error line is logged
  - New options are added to existing files after updates
  - Short startup log (one summary line), details with debug: true

  Economy
  - Added built-in currency without Vault (economy.type: internal, default)
  - Added /balance, /pay, /baltop and /eco give|take|set|log
  - Added daily login bonus, coins for playtime in other worlds (AFK is not counted)
    and coins for world owners when new players visit
  - Added operations log for admins
  - Vault is still supported with economy.type: vault or auto

  Ratings
  - Replaced likes and dislikes with 1-5 stars (/rate, five stars menu)
  - /like is 5 stars, /dislike is 1 star
  - Worlds are sorted by weighted (Bayesian) rating
  - Old likes are migrated as 5 stars, dislikes as 1 star
  - Owners get a message when their world is rated

  Upgrades
  - Added /upgrades: extra coding floors, bigger world size and world slots for coins
  - Prices and maximums in shop.yml
  - "My limits" shows group limit + bought upgrades
  - Contest worlds are not counted in worlds limit

  Backups
  - Added automatic world backups (world and developer world) on a timer
  - Added /backups menu: create, restore, list with dates and sizes
  - A "before restore" backup is made before every rollback
  - Admins can back up and restore any world (opencreativepp.backup.admin)

  Code marketplace
  - Added /market: share code modules for free or sell them for coins
  - Buyers get a license to install the module in any of their worlds
  - Server commission, minimum and maximum prices, listings limit in shop.yml
  - Paid modules can't be installed without a license
  - Modules are rated with stars after installation

  Build contests
  - Added /contest: admins create contests with theme, generator, size, durations and rewards
  - Phases: building, voting, results
  - Every participant gets a separate world
  - Contest worlds are locked after building, players vote with stars
  - Winners get coins and commands, their worlds can be added to recommended
  - Contest button in compass, line in lobby sidebar, announcements and titles

  Website
  - Added built-in website (web.site, port 22913): best worlds, playing now, new worlds
  - Added world pages and current contest page
  - Added JSON API: /api/worlds and /api/contest

  Compass and menus
  - Compass in hotbar slot 5 with 4 tabs: Recommended, My worlds, Favorites, Search
  - Added "Continue" button, category filter, "playing now" sort, search by description
  - Added "My limits" menu instead of join title
  - Added /profile [player]: worlds, rating, favorites, recent worlds, invite button
  - World name, author and rating are shown above the hotbar on world join

  Chat and lobby
  - Added colored chat and signs (&a, &l, HEX &#RRGGBB) with permission for each style
  - Signs keep their color codes when edited again
  - Added lobby sidebar and TAB header (online, worlds, balance, group, contest)
  - Added Discord webhook: new worlds, contests, market sales

  Worlds
  - Added datapacks in worlds for Premium (/datapack) with validation of every pack
  - Added "Run datapack function" world action
  - Added 5 world types: desert, snowy plains, beach, stone and nether flats

  Fixed bugs of OpenCreative+
  - Fixed swapped green and blue colors in coding
  - Fixed lost saved color variables
  - Fixed code line stopping when condition, repeat or function has no targets
  - Fixed two "Repeat N times" in a row
  - Fixed actions after "Wait" running after /build
  - Fixed "code is saving" forever after an error
  - Fixed lost code changes on world unload
  - Fixed particles that need data since 1.21.9
  - Fixed players stuck in "connecting"
  - Fixed flight carried between worlds
  - Fixed new rank not expanding the world
  - Fixed world settings reset after unload
  - Fixed spawn inside the ground
  - Fixed console error on every world creation
  - Fixed player items disappearing after shift-click or drag in menus
  - Fixed world icon taking the whole stack
  - Fixed "Kick all" kicking the owner
  - Fixed chat input requests never expiring (now 60 seconds and "cancel")
  - Fixed broken vanilla /give, /tp, /gamemode syntax for admins
  - Fixed /time set night
  - Fixed filter.yml failing to load on every start
  2026
